From 2c9d99c4b156e0f9f7f28a3f23b2b6f42663fccc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Craterbrain <58347640+Craterbrain@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 22:39:31 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 89/91] PlaitOS: volume wake, home double-tap action, music
 player on headset

Volume keys wake the screen (plait_volume_wake_screen), home gets a double-tap action
from the same list as the long presses (plait_home_double_tap_action), and a wired or
Bluetooth headset starts the music player (plait_headset_connect_player). Ported from
LineageOS's PhoneWindowManager; the headset player has no Lineage code, only its setting.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WNZzm3UdaCB3bu67ZPQkVe
